	<title>Equities Market - Nairobi Securities Exchange PLC</title>
	<meta name="description" content="The Nairobi Securities Exchange PLC is the premium listing location for companies seeking to raise equity capital to support their growth needs. The NSE PLC offers a deep and liquid market for issuers enabling them to access a wide range of domestic and international retail and institutional investors." />
