	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p>The Nairobi Securities Exchange PLC is the premium listing location for companies seeking to raise equity capital to support their growth needs. The NSE PLC offers a deep and liquid market for issuers enabling them to access a wide range of domestic and international retail and institutional investors.<br />
The NSE equities market is comprised of three listing segments, each specifically designed to meet capital, liquidity as well as regulatory requirements for issuers of all sizes. Below is a list of market segments and the requirements to list on each of the segments;</p>
